SUMMARY:First Fridays at Convene by Dan Kosta Wine Lounge
DESCRIPTION:First Fridays at Convene by Dan Kosta Wine Lounge takes place from 6/5–12/4\, every first Friday from 5–7 PM. Guests are invited to unwind with Chardonnay or Pinot Noir from Convene by Dan Kosta paired with premium Tsar Nicoulai Osetra caviar.    Inspired by French traditions embraced during Dan Kosta’s early restaurant career\, the experience features elegant wine pairings alongside potato chips\, Bellwether Farms crème fraîche\, and fresh chives. Designed as a relaxed evening of wine\, lite bites\, and conversation\, this monthly gathering offers a refined yet welcoming way to begin the weekend.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/first-fridays-at-convene-by-dan-kosta-wine-lounge/
LOCATION:14210 Bacchus Lndg Way #300 , Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
CATEGORIES:Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Food and Wine Pairing,Sonoma County,Wine
