SUMMARY:Summer Music Series at B.R. Cohn Winery
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy the Summer Music Series at B.R. Cohn Winery\, running weekends from May 23 through October 31\, 2026\, from 12:30–3:00 PM. This seasonal experience features live performances from talented local artists set against the stunning backdrop of Olive Hill Estate Vineyards.    Sip B.R. Cohn wines by the glass or bottle\, book a guided tasting\, or simply drop in and relax with great music and sweeping vineyard views. Guests can also enjoy rotating food trucks offering delicious bites throughout the afternoon.    Whether you're looking for a laid-back weekend outing or a scenic wine country experience\, this series blends live music\, exceptional wine\, and Sonoma Valley beauty into the perfect summer tradition.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/summer-music-series-at-b-r-cohn-winery/
LOCATION:15000 Sonoma Highway, Glen Ellen, CA, 95442, United States
