SUMMARY:Golden Hour at Kosta Browne
DESCRIPTION:Join Kosta Browne Winery for Golden Hour\, a relaxed Friday afternoon series held in the courtyard in Sebastopol’s Barlow. From June 12 through July 31\, 2026\, guests are invited every Friday from 3:30–5:30 PM to unwind with wines by the glass and enjoy the lingering light of the season.    Known for its acclaimed Pinot Noir and Chardonnay sourced from California’s coastal edges and Burgundy’s storied hillsides\, Kosta Browne offers the perfect setting to sip and savor in a casual\, welcoming atmosphere.    Guests can settle into the courtyard\, enjoy exceptional wines\, and ease into the evening as the sun sets. This weekly summer series is a great way to experience the winery’s signature style in a laid-back\, social setting.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/golden-hour-at-kosta-browne/
LOCATION:220 Morris St, Sebastopol, CA, 95472, United States
GEO:-122.8200822;38.4049675
CATEGORIES:Drink,Outdoors,Sonoma County,Wine
