SUMMARY:Artist Reception: Carol Ann Korpi at Mayacamas Home
DESCRIPTION:Mayacamas Home presents Carol Ann Korpi’s “Reflections of Summer”\, on view July 16 through September 3\, 2026\, with an artist reception on Thursday\, July 16\, 2026\, from 5:00–8:00 PM.    Inspired by the shifting colors of the Sonoma County landscape\, Korpi’s abstract works capture the region’s signature light—cool coastal marine layers\, fresh vineyard greens\, golden summer grasses\, and rich cabernet tones of harvest.    Guests are invited to meet the artist while enjoying live flamenco guitar by El Oso and tastings of Shawn’s favorite wines. This special evening blends art\, music\, and wine in a relaxed\, welcoming gallery setting.    A celebration of creativity and place\, this reception offers a vibrant sensory experience rooted in Sonoma’s natural beauty.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/artist-reception-carol-ann-korpi-at-mayacamas-home/
LOCATION:3975 Mountain Home Ranch Road, Calistoga, CA, 94515, United States
GEO:-122.650477;38.570171
CATEGORIES:Art Exhibit,Arts,Family Friendly,Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/06/28131056/Picture1.jpg
